          {
            "filename": "OST-6800.pdf",
            "text": "INVOICE\nOstrander Steel Stock\nInvoice No: OST-6800\nInvoice Date: 2026-02-27\nBill To: Brackwater Industrial Supply, Accounts Payable\nPO Number: PO-7800\nDescription: HDPE sheet stock\nAmount Due: $5,856.00 USD\nDue Date: 2026-03-10\nPayment: bank transfer to the account on file with your AP department\nQuestions: billing@ostrander-steel-stock.example"
